# From the AI Hair Color photo picker, pick the Pexels stock portrait (woman in a knitted hat, candle behind) used
# for generations: the HairColor fixtures (hc_*, Shutterstock-watermarked) are rejected by the Custom generation
# with 「Please Try Different Content」 (CONTENT_REJECTED, R1-d, credits refunded).
# Starts: the picker (after open-hair-color.steps). Ends: Pexels results for 「woman portrait」 typed, not yet searched.
# Pexels search 「woman portrait」: the photo is the 1st one in the right column. Charges nothing.
# Rewritten 2026-11-20 for the Pixel 8a (1080 x 2400 pixels; R3-d): the Pexels tab and the search field have no
# id or label in the page source (gettyimage_picker_edit_text is not found by `id`), so pixels are used.
# (Written 2026-11-13 for the SM-S9110: Pexels 755 462, field 500 618, photo 804 1363.)
lbl Stock
wait 4
tap 787 462
wait 2
tap 540 605
wait 1
type woman portrait
# Enter (search) is sent with adb: adb -s $CASEBOOK_SERIAL shell input keyevent 66, then: do pick-pexels-portrait-2.steps
